# ==============================================================================
# 32_repeat_loop_array.scara - Iterative Inspection Array via REPEAT Loop
# ==============================================================================
# Demonstrates fixed-iteration macro loops (REPEAT / END) with relative motions:
# 1. Closed-loop motor initialization, robot homing, and speed presets.
# 2. Linear motion to initial datum inspection feature.
# 3. Macro loop (REPEAT 4) performing an automated probe cycle:
#    - Vertical approach probe to surface level.
#    - Sensor acquisition dwell delay (WAIT_MS).
#    - Vertical retraction to transit clearance plane.
#    - Relative diagonal indexing step (MOVE_REL) to the next inspection point.
# 4. Return to home transit pose and drive de-energization.
# ==============================================================================

CONFIG MOTOR CLOSED_LOOP
ENABLE
HOME

SPEED WORK 40.0
SPEED RAPID 80.0

# Transit to initial inspection feature coordinate
MOVE_L X=120.0 Y=-30.0 Z=20.0 PHI=0.0 SPEED=50.0

# 4-point linear inspection scan using iterative macro loop
REPEAT 4
APPROACH DIST=5.0 SPEED=15.0
WAIT_MS 40
RETRACT DIST=5.0 SPEED=30.0
MOVE_REL X=15.0 Y=15.0 Z=0.0 PHI=0.0 SPEED=25.0
END

# Return to safe park position and disable motors
MOVE_L X=130.0 Y=0.0 Z=30.0 PHI=0.0 SPEED=60.0
DISABLE
